\"><div class=\"item-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see  cake base.<div class=\"p-weight\"></div><br/></div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Cake%20Keep%20Isle\">Cake Keep Isle</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>There used to be some edible cake here. Step on it to cover your feet in cake.<br/><br/>Part of the <a href=\"#/quest/a-piece-of-cake\">A Piece of Cake</a> <a href=\"#/wiki/World%20Quests\">World Quest</a>. Visit all of the <a href=\"#/wiki/Cake%20Extraction%20Machine\">Cake Extraction Machines</a> with cake on your feet and <a href=\"#/wiki/Brutus%20The%20Baker\">Brutus The Baker</a> will have a reward for you.\n</p>\n</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div class=\"navigation\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Related_Pages\">Related Pages</span></h3>\n<div class=\"navigation-body navigation-list-wrapper\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/quest/a-piece-of-cake\">A Piece of Cake</a></li><li>Cake (Wall)</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Cake%20Keep%20Isle\">Cake Keep Isle</a></li><li>Flooring</li><li>Tiles</li></ul>\n</div>\n</div></div></div>","quests":["a-piece-of-cake"],"howto":{"quests":[{"slug":"a-piece-of-cake","quest":"A Piece of Cake","step":"2-0","n":8,"title":"Falar com o Brutus","kind":"mention","coords":[{"x":33304,"y":32063,"z":7,"label":"Brutus The Baker"}]}]}}